    "text": "Theorem 1. For any item t\u2208 D consider two (if any) functions fandf\u2032where\u2207f(t)\u2264k1and\u2207f\u2032(t)\u2264k2. Also, consider a line segment lf,f\u2032starting from a point on the ray offand ending at a point on the ray of f\u2032. For any function f\u2032\u2032that its ray intersects lf,f\u2032,\u2207f\u2032\u2032(t)\u2264k1+k2.",
